03804-index.htm","tone":"warn"}],"summary":{"sentences":["Ouster, Inc. files with the SEC under \"General Industrial Machinery & Equipment, NEC\", based in CA, and has been publicly reporting for 5 years.","It reported $155.8m of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 48.9% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 42.9%.","Listed on Nasdaq, it is still consuming cash, with roughly 29 months of runway at the current burn."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Revenue grew 48.9% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025), reaching $48.6m in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1816581/000162828026030722/0001628280-26-030722-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-030722"},{"text":"Growth has been positive in all 8 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1816581/000162828026030722/0001628280-26-030722-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-030722"},{"text":"Net cash of $173.1m against total assets of $381.5m - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1816581/000162828026030722/0001628280-26-030722-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-030722"}],"bear":[{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-39.5% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1816581/000162828026030722/0001628280-26-030722-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-030722"},{"text":"About 29 months of cash at the current burn ($173.1m against $70.9m a year). A company that must raise is a company that raises on the buyer's terms.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1816581/000162828026030722/0001628280-26-030722-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-030722"},{"text":"Diluted share count rose 17.8% over the year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). The company can grow while your share of it shrinks, and this is the number most commentary ignores.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1816581/000162828026030722/0001628280-26-030722-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-030722"},{"text":"Insiders disposed of 5.1% of their combined holdings over the last four quarters (146,219 shares across 14 ownership filings). People with the best view of the business were reducing their stake.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1816581/000119312526298524/0001193125-26-298524-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 35.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"gross_margin","comparison":"below","threshold":0.35,"consecutive":2,"current":0.429,"current_display":"42.9%","threshold_display":"35.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"Eight points of margin is a real deterioration rather than noise. Two consecutive quarters stops one bad quarter from forcing a sale.","editable":true},{"id":"growth_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Revenue growth falls below 24.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"revenue_growth_yoy","comparison":"below","threshold":0.24,"consecutive":2,"current":0.489,"current_display":"48.9%","threshold_display":"24.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"If growth halves and stays there, the reason you looked at this company has gone.","editable":true},{"id":"runway_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Cash runway falls below 12 months","metric":"runway_months","comparison":"below","threshold":12.0,"consecutive":1,"current":29.303,"current_display":"29 months","threshold_display":"12 mont